  "The name must be lowercase letters, digits and single hyphens, at most 32 characters, starting with a letter.": "名称必须以字母开头，最多 32 个字符，只能使用小写字母、数字和单个连字符。",
  "The name in SKILL.md is not the skill's name.": "SKILL.md 中的名称与技能名称不符。",
  "SKILL.md needs a description.": "SKILL.md 需要一段描述。",
  "The description is longer than 1,024 characters.": "描述超过 1,024 个字符。",
  'A path leaves the skill\'s folder with "..".': "有路径使用“..”跳出了技能文件夹。",
  "A path is absolute; paths must be relative to the skill's folder.": "发现绝对路径。路径必须相对于技能文件夹。",
  "A path has an empty part, a backslash, a control character or a reserved name.": "路径包含空部分、反斜杠、控制字符或保留名称。",
  "A path is longer than 200 bytes.": "路径长度超过 200 字节。",
  "A path is more than 8 folders deep.": "路径超过 8 层文件夹。",
  "Two paths differ only in letter case or Unicode form.": "两个路径仅在大小写或 Unicode 形式上不同。",
  "Only regular files are allowed; this is a link or a special file.": "只允许普通文件。此项是链接或特殊文件。",
  "The skill has more than 256 files.": "技能包含的文件超过 256 个。",
  "A file is larger than 1 MiB.": "一个文件超过 1 MiB。",
  "The skill is larger than 5 MiB in all.": "技能总大小超过 5 MiB。",
  "SKILL.md is larger than 64 KiB.": "SKILL.md 超过 64 KiB。",
  "A text file is not valid UTF-8.": "一个文本文件不是有效的 UTF-8。",
  "A credential is written here. Keep keys in the secret store and write $DSH_SECRET_<NAME> instead.": "文本中包含凭据。请将密钥保存在密钥存储中，并在此处写入 $DSH_SECRET_<NAME>。",
  "A key-like value or long encoded text is written here. Keep keys in the secret store and write $DSH_SECRET_<NAME> instead.": "文本中包含类似密钥的值或长编码文本。请将密钥保存在密钥存储中，并在此处写入 $DSH_SECRET_<NAME>。",
  "A password or an ID number is written here.": "文本中包含密码或证件号码。",
  "Invisible or direction-changing characters can hide text from the person.": "不可见字符或改变文字方向的字符可能隐藏文本。",
  "The text tells the agent to turn off approvals or the sandbox.": "文本要求代理关闭审批或沙箱。",
  "The text tells the agent to raise its own permission level or grant itself access.": "文本要求代理提高自己的权限级别或自行授予访问权限。",
  "The text tells the agent to hide what it does from the person.": "文本要求代理向使用者隐瞒自己的操作。",
  "The text tells the agent to read credentials and send them somewhere.": "文本要求代理读取凭据并发送到别处。",
  "A download is piped straight into a shell or interpreter.": "下载内容被直接传给 Shell 或解释器。",
  "This opens a remote shell to another machine.": "此操作会打开连接到另一台机器的远程 Shell。",
  "This can erase a disk or the home folder.": "此操作可能擦除磁盘或主文件夹。",
  "This writes to a system or boot folder.": "此操作会写入系统或启动文件夹。",
  "This reads a browser's or an agent's stored credentials.": "此操作会读取浏览器或代理保存的凭据。",
  "An address carries a user name, password or token.": "地址包含用户名、密码或令牌。",
  "An address points to this machine, the local network or a cloud metadata service.": "地址指向本机、本地网络或云元数据服务。",
  "An executable program is included; skills may hold scripts, not programs.": "技能包含可执行程序。技能可以包含脚本。",
  "Encoded code is decoded and run, which hides what it does.": "代码在解码后执行，隐藏了实际行为。",
  "Files outside SKILL.md, scripts/, references/ and assets/.": "发现位于 SKILL.md、scripts/、references/ 和 assets/ 之外的文件。",
  "A hidden file or folder.": "发现隐藏文件或文件夹。",
  "A binary file the check cannot read.": "检查无法读取一个二进制文件。",
  "The text tells the agent to ignore earlier instructions, take another identity or put the skill above the person.": "文本要求代理忽略先前指令、改换身份或将技能置于使用者之上。",
  "Long encoded text in the instructions.": "指令中包含长编码文本。",
  "Runs a command as an administrator.": "以管理员权限运行命令。",
  "Deletes folders recursively.": "递归删除文件夹。",
  "Installs packages.": "安装软件包。",
  "Schedules commands to run later.": "安排命令稍后运行。",
  "Changes a shell start file.": "更改 Shell 启动文件。",
  "Installs or controls a background service.": "安装或控制后台服务。",
  "Calls an outside address.": "访问外部地址。",
  "Calls an address built at run time.": "访问运行时构建的地址。",
  "A script; it runs only through the Bot's own shell, under its approval level.": "此脚本只能通过 Bot 自己的 Shell，在该 Bot 的审批级别下运行。",
  "A field that would run commands or grant tools; it is shown and never honoured.": "此字段可能运行命令或授予工具权限。它仅用于展示，不会生效。",
  "File-tool folder": "文件工具的文件夹",
  "Folder for these four file tools": "这四个文件工具使用的文件夹",
  "Clear folder": "清除文件夹",
  "The operating system blocked read or write access to {folder}. Allow Automagik to use this folder: on macOS, open System Settings > Privacy & Security > Files and Folders (or Full Disk Access); elsewhere, allow your user to read and write the folder. Your folder choice has been kept.": "操作系统阻止了对 {folder} 的读取或写入。请允许 Automagik 使用此文件夹：在 macOS 上，打开系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 文件与文件夹（或完全磁盘访问权限）；在其他系统上，允许你的用户读取和写入该文件夹。你选择的文件夹已保留。",
  "What will it do?": "它会做什么？",
  "Add instructions": "添加说明",
  "Part of the Bot's system prompt. You can change it later in its details.": "这是 Bot 系统提示词的一部分。你可以稍后在详情中更改。",
  "New Bots start at {level}.": "新 Bot 从 {level} 开始。",
  "This model uses its Hermes profile's own instructions.": "此模型使用其 Hermes 配置文件自己的说明。",
  "Force update": "强制更新",
  "Stop and update": "停止并更新",
  "Stops running conversations and sign-ins, installs every available update and restarts.": "停止正在进行的对话和登录，安装所有可用更新并重启。",
  "Running conversations, tasks and Bot sign-ins stop now. Bots that were signing in ask you to sign in again.": "正在进行的对话、任务和 Bot 登录将立即停止。正在登录的 Bot 会请你重新登录。",
  "Stopping conversations…": "正在停止对话…",
  "Downloading the Automagik update…": "正在下载 Automagik 更新…",
  "Installing…": "正在安装…",
  "Restarting…": "正在重启…",
  "Everything is up to date.": "全部已是最新版本。",
  "Updated.": "已更新。",
  "The plugins did not start, so the previous ones are back.": "插件未能启动，已恢复之前的版本。",
  "The Automagik update could not be downloaded. Try again.": "未能下载 Automagik 更新。请重试。",
  "This copy updates through your system's package manager.": "此副本通过系统的软件包管理器更新。",
  "The restart did not finish. Try again.": "重启未完成。请重试。",
  "Version {version} · {latest} available": "版本 {version} · {latest} 可用",
  "Plugin updates": "插件更新",
  "Plugins {version} need Automagik {line}; this app is {app}. Update Automagik first.": "插件 {version} 需要 Automagik {line}；此应用是 {app}。请先更新 Automagik。",
  "Plugins {version} need Automagik {base} or newer; this app is {app}.": "插件 {version} 需要 Automagik {base} 或更新版本；此应用是 {app}。",
