  "Checking the SSH details": "检查 SSH 信息",
  "Signing in with SSH": "SSH 登录",
  "Checking the host key": "检查主机密钥",
  "Finding Hermes": "查找 Hermes",
  "Starting Hermes": "启动 Hermes",
  "Opening the tunnel": "打开隧道",
