  "Only the computer Automagik runs on: agents elsewhere cannot reach this address.": "仅限运行 Automagik 的电脑：其他地方的智能体无法访问这个地址。",
  "Private network: agents on your private network can connect.": "专用网络：你专用网络里的智能体可以连接。",
  "Example setup": "配置示例",
  "For Claude Code, in a file named .mcp.json. Other agents ask for the same address and key.": "适用于 Claude Code，写在名为 .mcp.json 的文件里。其他智能体需要的也是同样的地址和密钥。",
  "Copy the example": "复制示例",
