  "Also reserved here: {label} (another {vendor} account).": "此处也为 {label} 保留了一个账号（另一个 {vendor} 账号）。",
  "Reserved here: {label}.": "已在此处预留给 {label}。",
  "Reserved by another installation: {label}.": "另一套安装已预留给 {label}。",
