  "Your Bots use the {name} sign-in on this computer. It is shared with your terminal.": "你的 Bot 使用这台电脑上的 {name} 登录。它与你的终端共用。",
  "{model} waits for you to confirm its account.": "{model} 正在等你确认它的账号。",
