  "Show supported native DSH controls, Context and Stats for this Bot. This switch changes visibility only, not permissions, model access or context policy.": "显示此 Bot 支持的原生 DSH 控件、上下文与统计。此开关只改变显示，不改变权限、模型访问或上下文策略。",
