  "Start new part carries nothing from this part. Earlier history remains searchable. Click Confirm new part to continue.": "新部分不会携带本部分内容。旧历史仍可搜索。点击“确认开始新部分”继续。",
  "Checkpoint now condenses this part while keeping protected recent messages. Start new part is separate and carries nothing. Native manual compaction is unavailable for Bot-managed Sessions.": "立即创建检查点会压缩本部分，并保留受保护的最近消息。开始新部分是独立操作，不携带旧内容。Bot 管理的会话不支持原生手动压缩。",
  "Memory review": "记忆审核",
  "Automatic memory review": "自动记忆审核",
  "Reviews this Bot’s own chat after idle turns. Independent of context compaction; no fixed ordering is promised.": "在空闲轮次后审核此 Bot 的私聊。与上下文压缩独立，不保证固定顺序。",
  "Automatic memory review is disabled by the host configuration.": "主机配置已禁用自动记忆审核。",
  "Memory review running. Disabling review prevents future passes; this pass may finish.": "记忆审核正在运行。关闭后不再启动后续审核，本次审核仍可能完成。",
  "Memory review pending.": "记忆审核等待中。",
  "Memory review idle.": "记忆审核空闲。",
  "Automatic memory review is off for this Bot.": "此 Bot 已关闭自动记忆审核。",
  "Memory tidy": "记忆整理",
  "Daily memory tidy": "每日记忆整理",
  "Once a day, when this Bot’s own memory has changed, its model merges repeats, retires what is over and moves details into topics. It uses tokens every day, so it is off until you turn it on. The memory panel can undo the latest tidy.": "每天一次，当此 Bot 自己的记忆有变化时，由它的模型合并重复条目、归档已结束的内容，并把细节移入主题。每天都会消耗令牌，因此默认关闭，需手动开启。可在记忆面板撤销最近一次整理。",
  "The daily memory tidy is disabled by the host configuration.": "主机配置已禁用每日记忆整理。",
  "The host configuration runs the daily memory tidy for every memory.": "主机配置已为所有记忆开启每日记忆整理。",
  "The daily memory tidy is on for this Bot.": "此 Bot 已开启每日记忆整理。",
  "The daily memory tidy is off for this Bot.": "此 Bot 已关闭每日记忆整理。",
  "Stats": "统计",
  "Refresh stats": "刷新统计",
  "Model and permissions are managed in Bot settings.": "模型与权限在 Bot 设置中管理。",
  "Native compaction is unavailable for Bot conversations. Use Bot Context controls to checkpoint safely.": "Bot 对话不支持原生压缩。请使用 Bot 上下文控件安全地创建检查点。",
